    {
      "tag": "span",
      "text": "The main element of art that I used in this piece was color, as that's the aspect I \"stole\" from the gallery piece I found, and the main focus of the piece. As for principles, I utilized mostly movement as the sunlight makes the scene move from the window, to the desks, to the boards in the background, and across the entire scene.",
